### Phase 1: Package Management Alignment
Before deployment, initial system package lookup loops on the Alpine host were resolved by adjusting the underlying community repository tree branches.

```bash
# Toggle and update the Alpine community repository branch to fix system repository loops
setup-apkrepos
```

### Phase 2: Container Engine Initialization
Once the repository synchronization was stabilized, the core container virtualization runtime tools were provisioned, started, and persisted across system reboots:

```bash
# Install Docker Engine and the Compose CLI plugin
apk add docker docker-cli-compose

# Start the Docker daemon infrastructure and enable it on system boot
rc-service docker start
rc-update add docker boot
```
